{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123984","id":4681140103,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFwSHhw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123984","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123984.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123984.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123984","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123984/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123984/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123984/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/04f132dbc5b249d3aa5e4f3dc56e695d91aec7e1","number":123984,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Out-line the `configured` check of `~StringName()`, to save binary size. 4mb off macOS, ~750kb off web.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSaves around ~4mb from release off macOS (~8mb on universal builds), and around ~745kb off web (though, it doesn't translate to the compressed size, but a little bit of a decompression speed boost is expected).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSo, I made this change because the `configured` check does not need to be in the hot path. Since there are thousands of `~StringName()` callers, i expected a few hundred kb savings (which is exactly what happened on web).\r\n\r\nTurns out macOS decided to make this shave off a whole 4mb instead. This is way out of my league of compiler understanding, but AI explains it with the \"machine outliner\" which is supposedly able to match the new pattern, but wasn't able to match the old. Other platforms are not expected to profit in the same extravagant way.\r\n\r\nBut anyway, tech astrology aside: woohoo size benefits! 🥳","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":1748